    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3e08187febc4a84819d9d23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那个特征鲜明的手势。那之后的加速……\n也就是说，她——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d72a912fcb3e6bcea47919b900255a1e196228c937f8e7950d69335f052c4ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb2e1c1047584f4a79d802f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那优等生般、极具明星气质的跑姿固然很棒……但如果，\n能将她“那边”的特质也巧妙地引出来的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "345822444106233dcfeac39a58e9d85a858ce44f1340ca562921a4d01ead1740",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130003.json",
